    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >:3</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >:3 is a puzzle platformer game in which you aim to move the titular character from <i>The Red Place</i> to <i>The Blue Place</i> in search of a more vibrant life. Explore 30 levels, each carefully designed to bring their own unique challenges. Each level has multiple endings and a hidden gemstone\u2014find them all to reach an alternate ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adorable, if simplistic character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to chase a ball of yarn around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yarn and :3 responsive switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;:3 (Angy Mode) (with Angy Mode music)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes its not yarn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 levels of yarn tossing nonsense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has two distinct endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game itself has more than one ending (there are two, which is more than one).</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >:3</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >:3 is a puzzle platformer game in which you aim to move the titular character from <i>The Red Place</i> to <i>The Blue Place</i> in search of a more vibrant life. Explore 30 levels, each carefully designed to bring their own unique challenges. Each level has multiple endings and a hidden gemstone\u2014find them all to reach an alternate ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adorable, if simplistic character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to chase a ball of yarn around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yarn and :3 responsive switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;:3 (Angy Mode) (with Angy Mode music)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes its not yarn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 levels of yarn tossing nonsense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has two distinct endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game itself has more than one ending (there are two, which is more than one).</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": ":3 s\u0336a\u0336v\u0336e\u0336s\u0336 \u0336t\u0336e\u0336h\u0336 \u0336w\u0336o\u0336r\u0336l\u0336d goes from a red place to a blue place in search of a more colorful life, while chasing balls of yarn across switches and potentially dying a lot and solving puzzles.",
